  "step_3": "The decision reason requires evaluating outcomes with probability less than 20% and increasing their weight by 10 percentage points. In this problem, no outcome has a probability below 20%, so the condition for applying the reason is not met — the reason cannot be applied. Therefore, even if the individual had used a similar reasoning, the reason itself is not applicable. Since the verbal report does not mention any such weighting or adjustment, and the decision reason is inapplicable due to the absence of low-probability outcomes, the individual did not use the decision reason. The reported justification is based on a different principle — trading lower probability for higher gains — which is not equivalent to the given decision reason. Thus, the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
